<font color="#ffffff">What do you say?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

342
00:24:14,160 --> 00:24:15,080
<font color="#ffffff">I'm with you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

343
00:24:15,160 --> 00:24:16,120
<font color="#ffffff">I'm in.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

344
00:24:16,800 --> 00:24:18,840
<font color="#ffffff">Then we strike tomorrow.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

345
00:24:37,520 --> 00:24:39,520
<font color="#ffffff">Hey! Where are you going?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

346
00:24:40,680 --> 00:24:42,040
<font color="#ffffff">Food delivery, brother.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

347
00:24:43,000 --> 00:24:45,080
<font color="#ffffff">Ordered by whom? Are you messing with me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

348
00:24:45,680 --> 00:24:47,400
<font color="#ffffff">Seriously? Hold on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

349
00:24:47,480 --> 00:24:49,360
<font color="#ffffff">If you don't believe me, look at this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

350
00:24:50,400 --> 00:24:52,160
<font color="#ffffff">Where? There's nothing there.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

351
00:24:54,440 --> 00:24:55,400
<font color="#ffffff">Just kidding.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

352
00:24:55,480 --> 00:24:57,040
<font color="#ffffff">Kidding? What--</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

353
00:25:00,720 --> 00:25:02,080
<font color="#ffffff">Jeez!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

354
00:25:08,920 --> 00:25:10,600
<font color="#ffffff">We got the key. Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

355
00:25:15,320 --> 00:25:16,480
<font color="#ffffff">How do I use this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

356
00:25:16,560 --> 00:25:18,160
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

357
00:25:18,240 --> 00:25:19,520
<font color="#ffffff">-Someone's coming.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Oh no!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

358
00:25:30,760 --> 00:25:31,760
<font color="#ffffff">Intruders!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

359
00:25:31,840 --> 00:25:33,040
<font color="#ffffff">-No!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

360
00:25:35,760 --> 00:25:37,120
<font color="#ffffff">Do we have to shoot?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

361
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:40,440
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

362
00:25:41,800 --> 00:25:43,880
<font color="#ffffff">It opened. Go, go, go! Move fast!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

363
00:25:44,440 --> 00:25:45,680
<font color="#ffffff">-You two go first!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

364
00:25:46,280 --> 00:25:47,600
<font color="#ffffff">-Get inside first!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Fine!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

365
00:25:47,680 --> 00:25:48,600
<font color="#ffffff">Go, Joke!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

366
00:26:16,520 --> 00:26:17,520
<font color="#ffffff">Impressive!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

367
00:26:18,120 --> 00:26:19,480
<font color="#ffffff">Mr. Killer Singer.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

368
00:26:19,560 --> 00:26:21,040
<font color="#ffffff">You're next.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

369
00:26:21,120 --> 00:26:22,960
<font color="#ffffff">I think your friends are.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

370
00:26:25,040 --> 00:26:27,200
<font color="#ffffff">-Let go! I said let go of me!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Move!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

371
00:26:27,280 --> 00:26:28,720
<font color="#ffffff">-Move it!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-All right! I'm moving.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

372
00:26:29,680 --> 00:26:30,840
<font color="#ffffff">Let go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

373
00:26:30,920 --> 00:26:32,440
<font color="#ffffff">Petch! Help us, Petch!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

374
00:26:33,720 --> 00:26:34,960
<font color="#ffffff">Joke.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

375
00:26:35,040 --> 00:26:35,880
<font color="#ffffff">Berm.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

376
00:26:35,960 --> 00:26:37,000
<font color="#ffffff">Drop the gun,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

377
00:26:37,080 --> 00:26:38,480
<font color="#ffffff">or they die!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

378
00:26:41,600 --> 00:26:42,920
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

379
00:26:44,440 --> 00:26:45,800
<font color="#ffffff">I said drop the gun!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

380
00:26:47,200 --> 00:26:48,560
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

381
00:27:02,040 --> 00:27:02,960
<font color="#ffffff">Grab him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

382
00:27:03,040 --> 00:27:03,920
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, boss.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

383
00:27:06,400 --> 00:27:07,280
<font color="#ffffff">Stay still.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

384
00:27:09,160 --> 00:27:10,560
<font color="#ffffff">Wait. Don't.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

385
00:27:14,880 --> 00:27:16,280
<font color="#ffffff">Ake?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

386
00:27:17,360 --> 00:27:18,680
<font color="#ffffff">That scumbag</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

387
00:27:20,160 --> 00:27:22,400
<font color="#ffffff">just walked right into our hands.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

388
00:27:22,480 --> 00:27:23,600
<font color="#ffffff">Get over here, quick.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

389
00:27:36,800 --> 00:27:39,760
<font color="#ffffff">The scumbag delivers himself</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">right to me for a beating.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

390
00:27:43,680 --> 00:27:44,720
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

391
00:27:45,800 --> 00:27:47,360
<font color="#ffffff">What's your problem?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

392
00:27:47,440 --> 00:27:48,480
<font color="#ffffff">What is it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

393
00:27:48,560 --> 00:27:50,360
<font color="#ffffff">That's enough.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

394
00:27:52,680 --> 00:27:53,680
<font color="#ffffff">Kill me if you want.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

395
00:27:55,280 --> 00:27:56,760
<font color="#ffffff">Just spare my friends.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

396
00:27:56,840 --> 00:27:58,240
<font color="#ffffff">A loyal friend, huh?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

397
00:27:59,360 --> 00:28:01,120
<font color="#ffffff">Truly fitting for a hero.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

398
00:28:02,800 --> 00:28:05,760
<font color="#ffffff">Do you think your money</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">buys you the right to do anything?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

399
00:28:08,160 --> 00:28:10,040
<font color="#ffffff">One day, you will burn in hell for this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

400
00:28:11,640 --> 00:28:13,480
<font color="#ffffff">Just like your old man, Nop?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

401
00:28:16,960 --> 00:28:18,280
<font color="#ffffff">What do you mean?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

402
00:28:21,480 --> 00:28:22,520
<font color="#ffffff">I was the one</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

403
00:28:23,200 --> 00:28:26,800
<font color="#ffffff">who ordered a bullet</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">through your father's head.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

404
00:28:28,880 --> 00:28:30,640
<font color="#ffffff">Then I staged the whole thing</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

405
00:28:30,720 --> 00:28:33,360
<font color="#ffffff">to look like a suicide.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

406
00:28:34,680 --> 00:28:35,560
<font color="#ffffff">You idiot!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

407
00:28:41,480 --> 00:28:42,480
<font color="#ffffff">You bastard!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

408
00:28:43,520 --> 00:28:44,800
<font color="#ffffff">Let go of me!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

409
00:28:44,880 --> 00:28:45,960
<font color="#ffffff">Let go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

410
00:28:47,000 --> 00:28:49,200
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, don't hurt Petch!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

411
00:28:50,280 --> 00:28:51,160
<font color="#ffffff">You think you're cool?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

412
00:28:54,760 --> 00:28:57,080
<font color="#ffffff">Right?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

413
00:29:06,680 --> 00:29:08,120
<font color="#ffffff">Even your own father</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

414
00:29:08,960 --> 00:29:10,680
<font color="#ffffff">died by my hand.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

415
00:29:11,680 --> 00:29:13,360
<font color="#ffffff">You think you can touch me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

416
00:29:14,560 --> 00:29:15,800
<font color="#ffffff">You're just a stray dog.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

417
00:29:19,080 --> 00:29:20,000
<font color="#ffffff">You monster!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

418
00:29:21,320 --> 00:29:22,880
<font color="#ffffff">You'll never die a peaceful death.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

419
00:29:24,280 --> 00:29:25,880
<font color="#ffffff">Worry about yourself first.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

420
00:29:26,440 --> 00:29:28,560
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Petch!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

421
00:29:28,640 --> 00:29:30,400
<font color="#ffffff">-Petch!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Petch!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

422
00:29:30,480 --> 00:29:31,520
<font color="#ffffff">-He fainted.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Petch!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

423
00:29:31,600 --> 00:29:33,520
<font color="#ffffff">-Petch!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

424
00:29:35,760 --> 00:29:37,160
<font color="#ffffff">Finish him off.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

425
00:29:39,640 --> 00:29:41,320
<font color="#ffffff">Keep him alive for now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

426
00:29:42,320 --> 00:29:44,040
<font color="#ffffff">It's not his time yet.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

427
00:29:44,120 --> 00:29:45,640
<font color="#ffffff">Why are we keeping him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

428
00:29:46,320 --> 00:29:47,680
<font color="#ffffff">You'll find out soon.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

429
00:30:02,840 --> 00:30:03,920
<font color="#ffffff">It's all empty.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

430
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:06,360
<font color="#ffffff">Seeing you eat so well,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

431
00:30:06,440 --> 00:30:08,640
<font color="#ffffff">you'll get well very soon.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

432
00:30:08,720 --> 00:30:10,280
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you so much, sweetheart.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

433
00:30:19,840 --> 00:30:21,000
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

434
00:30:26,560 --> 00:30:28,040
<font color="#ffffff">I ended up here…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

435
00:30:28,120 --> 00:30:29,960
<font color="#ffffff">because of my own doing,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

436
00:30:30,600 --> 00:30:33,280
<font color="#ffffff">for forcing you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">into that engagement with Ake.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

437
00:30:36,600 --> 00:30:38,480
<font color="#ffffff">Please don't think like that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

438
00:30:38,560 --> 00:30:40,280
<font color="#ffffff">That's all in the past now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

439
00:30:41,160 --> 00:30:44,400
<font color="#ffffff">But I truly want to apologize to you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

440
00:30:45,320 --> 00:30:46,640
<font color="#ffffff">Now that I know</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

441
00:30:47,240 --> 00:30:49,040
<font color="#ffffff">when I was unconscious,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

442
00:30:49,600 --> 00:30:52,280
<font color="#ffffff">Petch came to play music for me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

443
00:30:52,880 --> 00:30:54,400
<font color="#ffffff">I feel even more guilty</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

444
00:30:54,480 --> 00:30:59,920
<font color="#ffffff">and ashamed of how</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I used to look down on him.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

445
00:31:00,920 --> 00:31:03,160
<font color="#ffffff">Petch never held a grudge.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

446
00:31:03,240 --> 00:31:05,280
<font color="#ffffff">Please don't worry about it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

447
00:31:10,600 --> 00:31:11,880
<font color="#ffffff">Do you know</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

448
00:31:13,200 --> 00:31:16,040
<font color="#ffffff">that the song Petch played for me</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

449
00:31:16,120 --> 00:31:21,480
<font color="#ffffff">reminded me of</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">when your father and I got married?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

450
00:31:23,160 --> 00:31:24,520
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't choose your father</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

451
00:31:25,440 --> 00:31:28,520
<font color="#ffffff">for his status or money.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

452
00:31:30,200 --> 00:31:33,320
<font color="#ffffff">I chose him because we loved each other.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

453
00:31:34,640 --> 00:31:35,520
<font color="#ffffff">However,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

454
00:31:35,600 --> 00:31:38,000
<font color="#ffffff">I tried to control your life.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

455
00:31:40,640 --> 00:31:42,280
<font color="#ffffff">I must have forgotten</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

456
00:31:43,000 --> 00:31:46,720
<font color="#ffffff">that you can't force someone's heart.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

457
00:31:49,680 --> 00:31:51,840
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you so much, Mom,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

458
00:31:51,920 --> 00:31:53,800
<font color="#ffffff">for finally understanding me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

459
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:56,520
<font color="#ffffff">Dao,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

460
00:31:57,520 --> 00:31:58,680
<font color="#ffffff">from now on,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

461
00:31:59,800 --> 00:32:01,520
<font color="#ffffff">whoever you love,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

462
00:32:01,600 --> 00:32:03,440
<font color="#ffffff">I will love them too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

463
00:32:04,720 --> 00:32:06,080
<font color="#ffffff">Are you serious?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

464
00:32:08,920 --> 00:32:10,120
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you so much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

465
00:32:30,200 --> 00:32:32,040
<font color="#ffffff">PETCH</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

466
00:32:33,200 --> 00:32:34,040
<font color="#ffffff">Petch?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

467
00:32:34,120 --> 00:32:37,440
<font color="#ffffff">I couldn't reach you at all.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Where have you been?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

468
00:32:37,520 --> 00:32:40,080
<font color="#ffffff"><i>You've never talked to me</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>in that tone before.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

469
00:32:40,160 --> 00:32:41,360
<font color="#ffffff">You again?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

470
00:32:42,560 --> 00:32:44,440
<font color="#ffffff">Speak to me nicely, will you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

471
00:32:45,040 --> 00:32:47,120
<font color="#ffffff">Just like how you talk to Petch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

472
00:32:47,200 --> 00:32:49,520
<font color="#ffffff">If you do, I might find it in my heart</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

473
00:32:49,600 --> 00:32:51,120
<font color="#ffffff">to show him some mercy</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

474
00:32:51,200 --> 00:32:52,440
<font color="#ffffff">and spare his life.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

475
00:32:52,960 --> 00:32:54,160
<font color="#ffffff">What will you do to him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

476
00:32:54,240 --> 00:32:55,240
<font color="#ffffff"><i>If you want to know,</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

477
00:32:55,320 --> 00:32:56,680
<font color="#ffffff"><i>meet me at the usual place.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

478
00:32:56,760 --> 00:32:57,800
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Right now.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

479
00:33:05,080 --> 00:33:06,160
<font color="#ffffff">What do you want?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

480
00:33:08,320 --> 00:33:09,640
<font color="#ffffff">Just cut to the chase.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

481
00:33:10,680 --> 00:33:11,960
<font color="#ffffff">So fierce.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

482
00:33:12,560 --> 00:33:14,320
<font color="#ffffff">I really love that about you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

483
00:33:14,920 --> 00:33:16,600
<font color="#ffffff">Stop talking nonsense.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

484
00:33:16,680 --> 00:33:18,360
<font color="#ffffff">Say what you have to say.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

485
00:33:19,600 --> 00:33:21,440
<font color="#ffffff">I was just about to ask you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

486
00:33:22,560 --> 00:33:26,520
<font color="#ffffff">Should I send Petch</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to join his father in hell or not?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

487
00:33:29,800 --> 00:33:31,040
<font color="#ffffff">Take a look at this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

488
00:33:32,240 --> 00:33:34,680
<font color="#ffffff">It might help you make up your mind.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

489
00:33:38,720 --> 00:33:39,760
<font color="#ffffff">-Petch!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-No.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

490
00:33:41,280 --> 00:33:42,680
<font color="#ffffff">Not so fast, honey.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

491
00:33:44,200 --> 00:33:47,320
<font color="#ffffff">You can barely watch him get beaten up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

492
00:33:47,960 --> 00:33:49,840
<font color="#ffffff">If he actually dies,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

493
00:33:51,520 --> 00:33:52,920
<font color="#ffffff">how are you going to live?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

494
00:33:53,840 --> 00:33:55,000
<font color="#ffffff">Let Petch go</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

495
00:33:55,520 --> 00:33:57,400
<font color="#ffffff">and tell me what you want!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

496
00:33:57,480 --> 00:33:58,800
<font color="#ffffff">I can give you anything.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

497
00:34:03,960 --> 00:34:05,400
<font color="#ffffff">Marry me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

498
00:34:11,560 --> 00:34:12,679
<font color="#ffffff">If you agree,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

499
00:34:13,600 --> 00:34:14,840
<font color="#ffffff">Petch lives.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

500
00:34:16,280 --> 00:34:17,600
<font color="#ffffff">If you don't…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

501
00:34:21,080 --> 00:34:22,280
<font color="#ffffff">he dies.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

502
00:34:32,800 --> 00:34:33,800
<font color="#ffffff">Fine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

503
00:34:35,040 --> 00:34:36,040
<font color="#ffffff">I agree.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

504
00:34:37,480 --> 00:34:39,040
<font color="#ffffff">But how do I know</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

505
00:34:39,120 --> 00:34:40,560
<font color="#ffffff">you're not lying to me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

506
00:34:42,719 --> 00:34:44,159
<font color="#ffffff">I thought you would say that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

507
00:34:44,239 --> 00:34:47,320
<font color="#ffffff">So I'll take you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to see it with your own eyes.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

508
00:34:52,199 --> 00:34:55,320
<font color="#ffffff">-Let go of me!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Move!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

509
00:34:55,400 --> 00:34:58,000
<font color="#ffffff">-What the hell?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Why are you taking us here?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

510
00:35:01,040 --> 00:35:02,240
<font color="#ffffff">Afraid to die?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

511
00:35:04,240 --> 00:35:05,680
<font color="#ffffff">Just kill me if you want.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

512
00:35:05,760 --> 00:35:06,880
<font color="#ffffff">Save your breath!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

513
00:35:07,480 --> 00:35:08,440
<font color="#ffffff">Sharp as always.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

514
00:35:09,120 --> 00:35:10,080
<font color="#ffffff">Do it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

515
00:35:10,160 --> 00:35:11,280
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

516
00:35:11,360 --> 00:35:12,640
<font color="#ffffff">-Petch!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Petch!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

