<font color="#ffffff">The further, the better!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

688
00:46:21,400 --> 00:46:22,840
<font color="#ffffff">Without you,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

689
00:46:22,920 --> 00:46:24,280
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not going anywhere either.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

690
00:46:25,040 --> 00:46:27,040
<font color="#ffffff">I already negotiated with Ake!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

691
00:46:27,120 --> 00:46:29,440
<font color="#ffffff">Why did you have to do</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">something this stupid?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

692
00:46:30,040 --> 00:46:33,040
<font color="#ffffff">Are you out of your mind? Are you insane?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

693
00:46:33,120 --> 00:46:34,840
<font color="#ffffff">Do you want to die?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

694
00:46:36,600 --> 00:46:37,560
<font color="#ffffff">I knew it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

695
00:46:38,520 --> 00:46:39,960
<font color="#ffffff">You did it to save me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

696
00:46:40,920 --> 00:46:42,680
<font color="#ffffff">Ake let me go</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

697
00:46:43,720 --> 00:46:45,520
<font color="#ffffff">because you agreed to marry him, right?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

698
00:46:46,720 --> 00:46:47,600
<font color="#ffffff">Right?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

699
00:46:51,000 --> 00:46:52,240
<font color="#ffffff">Enough, Dao.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

700
00:46:53,200 --> 00:46:54,960
<font color="#ffffff">You've sacrificed way too much for me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

701
00:46:58,600 --> 00:46:59,680
<font color="#ffffff">You're coming with me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

702
00:47:00,440 --> 00:47:02,520
<font color="#ffffff">I won't let you marry him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

703
00:47:02,600 --> 00:47:03,440
<font color="#ffffff">Come here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

704
00:47:03,520 --> 00:47:04,920
<font color="#ffffff">Let go, Petch!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

705
00:47:05,000 --> 00:47:05,840
<font color="#ffffff">Petch!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

706
00:47:06,880 --> 00:47:08,760
<font color="#ffffff">Life isn't that easy.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

707
00:47:09,720 --> 00:47:11,880
<font color="#ffffff">The closer you are to me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

708
00:47:12,600 --> 00:47:15,080
<font color="#ffffff">the shorter your life will be.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

709
00:47:16,800 --> 00:47:17,840
<font color="#ffffff">I don't care!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

710
00:47:18,640 --> 00:47:19,880
<font color="#ffffff">If I die, I die!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

711
00:47:22,520 --> 00:47:23,640
<font color="#ffffff">You don't understand.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

712
00:47:24,560 --> 00:47:26,280
<font color="#ffffff">You never understand anything.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

713
00:47:27,000 --> 00:47:28,760
<font color="#ffffff">Just run away.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

714
00:47:28,840 --> 00:47:30,920
<font color="#ffffff">Go as far as the edge of the earth!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

715
00:47:31,840 --> 00:47:32,760
<font color="#ffffff">Fine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

716
00:47:34,680 --> 00:47:36,240
<font color="#ffffff">But before you go,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

717
00:47:37,440 --> 00:47:39,880
<font color="#ffffff">look me in the eye</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and answer me one thing.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

718
00:47:42,480 --> 00:47:43,880
<font color="#ffffff">Do you love me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

719
00:47:46,920 --> 00:47:48,080
<font color="#ffffff">It's because I love you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

