00:47:49,680 --> 00:47:51,320
<font color="#ffffff">that I can't be with you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

721
00:48:03,040 --> 00:48:04,200
<font color="#ffffff">Dao!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

722
00:48:11,920 --> 00:48:13,000
